  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentially_Currency/BH_EC_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"350\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentially_Currency/BH_EC_Overview.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Currency 是一款简单的模组，添加了多种硬币。</li>\n<li>可以制作各种硬币。</li>\n<li>硬币可用于玩家之间的交易。</li>\n<li>玩家现在可以用一种全新的方式来评估物品价值，而不仅仅是通过交换不同资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">各种纹理的制作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fMegaDeker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MegaDekker</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentially_Currency/BH_EC_PlannedContent.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>为结构战利品添加硬币，使玩家可以在战利品箱中找到硬币。</li>\n<li>自定义村民交易，允许玩家使用硬币交易或换取硬币。</li>\n<li>移除铜币的合成配方，以使货币更加稀有（将在上述功能实现后加入）。</li>\n<li>更多基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-metals-ii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Metals</a> 的硬币类型。</li>\n<li>美元纸币 / 货币票据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsWATPgvzx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentially_Currency/BH_EC_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"151\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fprogression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentially_Currency/BH_EC_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"351\"></a></p>",
